      "content": "Just saw a message and it got me thinking...\n\nIf BTC can break through the key resistance level at $66,000, then I believe it could likely keep rising all the way to $68,000, because recent trading volume has already shown an upward trend.\n\nIf ETH’s price can hold above $1,900 and the 24-hour trading volume continues to increase, then I expect it to remain bullish, with a target price of $2,000, since its movement is strongly correlated with BTC.\n\nI think it’s more likely that BTC will break above $66,000, because recent market conditions show that its price has risen from $64,777.00 to $65,474.46, indicating an upward trend.\n\nIf this trend continues, I expect BTC to keep trending bullish, pulling the entire market upward as well—so I’m bullish on BTC and the whole market.\n\n#BTC #ETH # LOOKDAWG \n🐳",
